// DOCTYPE {AOT}
// ============================================================================
// Void Browser — Internal page browser for StratOS
// apps/browser/browser.lx
//
// Features:
//   - Tab bar with multiple tabs
//   - URL/address bar with navigation buttons
//   - Internal stratos:// pages (home, about, help)
//   - Scroll support
//   - Mouse click on tabs, nav buttons, links
//   - Keyboard nav (arrows to scroll, Ctrl+T new tab, Ctrl+W close tab)
// ============================================================================

